    "q-85526": {
      "dom_id": "step-q85526",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "Due to acaricides, the population of ticks in a certain park decreases according to the expression $20\\,000\\cdot (0.7)^{t},$ where $t$ is the time, in weeks, since acaricides were first applied. What does the base of the exponential expression $(0.7)$ mean in this context?",
      "worked_solution": "The given expression is an exponential decay expression of the form $y(t)=a\\cdot (1-r)^{t},$ where:\n\n- $a=20\\,000$ represents the initial number of ticks.\n\n- $1-r=0.7,$ where $r$ is the decay rate.\n\n- $t$ is the time, in weeks, since the acaricides were first applied.\n\nSolving for $r,$ we get\n\n$$\n1-r=0.7\\,⟹\\,r=0.3.\n$$\n\nNow, $0.3$ (expressed as a percent) is equal to $30%.$ \n\nSo, the base of the exponential expression $0.7$ means that the population of ticks decreases by $30%$ every week.",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-85526-a",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "The population of ticks decreases by $70%$ every week",
              "html": "The population of ticks decreases by <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"96\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> every week"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-85526-b",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "The population of ticks increases by $30%$ every week",
